{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1768"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c148): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c148.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1768"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/tv","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__tv.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",6],["-","producing"],["+","offering"],["=",9],["-","2013,"],["+","2012,"],["=",47],["-","Five"],["+","Six"],["=",25],["+","The first step was a small one, taken in Norway. Lilyhammer, a co-production with the Norwegian public broadcaster NRK, premiered there on 25 January 2012 and arrived on Netflix a few weeks later, promoted as the service's first exclusive series – a year before House of Cards. Steven Van Zandt, guitarist of Bruce Springsteen's E Street Band and Silvio Dante in The Sopranos, plays the New York gangster Frank Tagliano, who testifies against his boss, enters witness protection and picks Lillehammer, the host of the 1994 Winter Olympics, as his hiding place. The culture clash between a mobster and Norwegian politeness carried the show through three seasons until 2014.\n\n"],["=",914],["+","Lilyhammer | 2012 | Norway, USA |\n| "],["=",79]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",4],["-","2013"],["+","2012"],["=",7],["-","zu"],["+","anzubieten,"],["=",1],["-","produzieren, "],["=",40],["-","Fünf"],["+","Sechs"],["=",27],["+","Der erste Schritt war ein kleiner, und er geschah in Norwegen. Lilyhammer, eine Koproduktion mit dem norwegischen öffentlich-rechtlichen Sender NRK, startete dort am 25. Januar 2012 und kam wenige Wochen später zu Netflix, beworben als erste exklusive Serie des Dienstes – ein Jahr vor House of Cards. Steven Van Zandt, Gitarrist von Bruce Springsteens E Street Band und Silvio Dante in Die Sopranos, spielt den New Yorker Gangster Frank Tagliano, der gegen seinen Boss aussagt, ins Zeugenschutzprogramm geht und sich Lillehammer, den Austragungsort der Olympischen Winterspiele 1994, als Versteck aussucht. Der Zusammenprall von Mafioso und norwegischer Höflichkeit trug die Serie durch drei Staffeln bis 2014.\n\n"],["=",848],["+","Lilyhammer | 2012 | Norwegen, USA |\n| "],["=",75]]}]},
